  "statement": "You're given a grid of lowercase letters, `board`, and a list of distinct words. Return every word from the list that can be spelled on the board.\n\nA word is spelled by starting on any cell and moving to a horizontally or vertically adjacent cell for each next letter. Within one word, a cell can be used at most once. List each found word once, in any order.\n\nConstraints: 1 <= rows, columns <= 12; 1 <= len(words) <= 3 * 10^4; 1 <= len(word) <= 10; letters are lowercase English; the words are distinct.",
  "functionName": "find_words",
  "signature": "def find_words(board: List[List[str]], words: List[str]) -> List[str]:",
  "starterCode": "def find_words(board: List[List[str]], words: List[str]) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"Return every word from words that can be traced on the board, in any order.\"\"\"\n    pass\n",
